{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "おはようございます\nこんにちは\nこんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 菅原咲月（すがわらさつき）です🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お久しぶりの更新ですね\n有難いことにいろんなお仕事させて頂いていて、プライベートの写真がなかなかない〜\n行きたいところとか、やりたいことはあるんだけどね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobrK6rZE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浴衣🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年はお仕事で着る機会が多くて幸せだった〜\nいつもと違う雰囲気、楽しんでくれてるかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobSw68tJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こちらは「ホリケンのみんなともだち」になおと出演した時📸\n桃デザインの浴衣だよ〜かわいい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "8/23まで開催中のサマフェスを思う存分体験した日☀️\n暑さすらも楽しくなってしまうロケでした❤️‍🔥\nまだTVerさんで観られるので是非！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗\nhttps://tver.jp/episodes/ep9ctj8sbd"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗\nhttps://tver.jp/episodes/ep1stvs526"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、先週末は福岡公演でした！\n地方公演ラストは福岡🍓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "各地、足を運んでくださった皆様\nありがとうございました😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtube.com/live/48-0nZqxo44"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色々な流れは週刊乃木坂ニュースでちらっと話していますのでお時間ある方はみてみてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "残すは1週間後に迫ってきている神宮のみです\n4日間オンライン配信も決定しました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/s/n46/news/detail/102142"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年の夏の集大成、見届けてください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobAkz0FW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてあやてぃさんの卒セレ💐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵すぎるドレスだった〜、、、\n一緒にセレモニーのステージに立てたこと、とても幸せに思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "真っ直ぐに届く歌声も、メンバーの顔を愛おしそうに見つめるお顔も忘れられないです\nこの先のあやてぃさんの未来が幸せいっぱいで溢れますように💐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobOlPPw4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しすぎてブレちゃった。笑\n宝物です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近はお天気あまり良くない日が続いてるね\nみんな大丈夫〜〜？？\n気を付けるんだよ〜！😞"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日25時〜TBSラジオ\n「JUNK バナナマンのバナナムーンGOLD」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "池田川﨑と出演します！\n嬉しい！！！嬉しすぎる！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夢のようです。\nお時間合う方は是非☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "では、また書きます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobBPMRfD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日の一曲。\nフォルテシモ / 乃木坂46"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026.8.14"}], "source": "official"}